{"suttaId":"tha-ap490","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2295,2342],"vripara":"148"},"segments":{"tha-ap490:0.3":"Taraṇiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap490:1.1":"“Atthadassī tu bhagavā, sayambhū lokanāyako;","tha-ap490:1.3":"Vinatā nadiyā tīraṃ [tīre (syā. pī. ka.)], upāgacchi tathāgato.","tha-ap490:2.1":"“Udakā abhinikkhamma, kacchapo vārigocaro;","tha-ap490:2.3":"Buddhaṃ tāretukāmohaṃ, upesiṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap490:3.1":"“‘Abhirūhatu maṃ buddho, atthadassī mahāmuni;","tha-ap490:3.3":"Ahaṃ taṃ tārayissāmi, dukkhassantakaro tuvaṃ’.","tha-ap490:4.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, atthadassī mahāyaso;","tha-ap490:4.3":"Abhirūhitvā me piṭṭhiṃ, aṭṭhāsi lokanāyako.","tha-ap490:5.1":"“Yato sarāmi attānaṃ, yato pattosmi viññutaṃ;","tha-ap490:5.3":"Sukhaṃ me tādisaṃ natthi, phuṭṭhe pādatale yathā.","tha-ap490:6.1":"“Uttaritvāna sambuddho, atthadassī mahāyaso;","tha-ap490:6.3":"Nadītīramhi ṭhatvāna, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap490:7.1":"“‘Yāvatā vattate cittaṃ, gaṅgāsotaṃ tarāmahaṃ;","tha-ap490:7.3":"Ayañca kacchapo rājā, tāresi mama paññavā.","tha-ap490:8.1":"“‘Iminā buddhataraṇena, mettacittavatāya ca;","tha-ap490:8.3":"Aṭṭhārase kappasate, devaloke ramissati.","tha-ap490:9.1":"“‘Devalokā idhāgantvā, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap490:9.3":"Ekāsane nisīditvā, kaṅkhāsotaṃ tarissati.","tha-ap490:10.1":"“‘Yathāpi bhaddake khette, bījaṃ appampi ropitaṃ;","tha-ap490:10.3":"Sammādhāre pavacchante, phalaṃ toseti kassakaṃ [kassake (syā.)].","tha-ap490:11.1":"“‘Tathevidaṃ buddhakhettaṃ, sammāsambuddhadesitaṃ;","tha-ap490:11.3":"Sammādhāre pavacchante, phalaṃ maṃ tosayissati’.","tha-ap490:12.1":"“Padhānapahitattomhi, upasanto nirūpadhi;","tha-ap490:12.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap490:13.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap490:13.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, taraṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap490:14.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap490:15.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap490:16.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap490:17.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā taraṇiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap490:18.1":"Taraṇiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
